oma per quaranta giorni.Padre Lozano,sacerdote dell'ospedale,le pratica l'estrema unzione e viene staccata dalle macchine.A sorpresa,Angela si riprende.Tutto sembra tornato normale,ma è l'inizio di un incubo.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Per duemila anni il Vaticano ha nascosto le prove del male","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2015-07-23","status":"Released","rating":5.35,"ratingCount":847,"genres":["Thriller","Horror"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"91m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":999817,"name":"Olivia Taylor Dudley","role":"Angela Holmes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcYv3aYSMNbGcYHehUjeEg1UwqY.jpg"},{"id":454,"name":"Michael Peña","role":"Père Lozano","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/afs4PCiwn8LR93a10drULLVeVLo.jpg"},{"id":21193,"name":"Peter Andersson","role":"Cardinal Bruun","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3QrCFAESqlCgwg10KLv1Wre0sKL.jpg"},{"id":938,"name":"Djimon Hounsou","role":"Vicar Imani","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tpvtxxvCx2Mb5DV632hmuYlHoiY.jpg"},{"id":33676,"name":"Kathleen Robertson","role":"Docteur Richards","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nGaey63oyvcZWXFEwaihGP2YryY.jpg"},{"id":2444499,"name":"Montanna Gillis","role":"Jackie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mW7w9bfR6ef4VgOANXOqa2xbLnT.jpg"},{"id":1862014,"name":"Noemi Gonzalez","role":"Maria","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9BXgDrNRYy6wp0gxFP5qpqc6B5x.jpg"},{"id":8291,"name":"Alison Lohman","role":"Psych Patient","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i5oXlQE2d0OP9HrEYo7V5JXbdWL.jpg"},{"id":15336,"name":"Dougray Scott","role":"Roger Holmes","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDjTHSZuUIEstxxBvHApLrU1fWz.jpg"},{"id":43464,"name":"John Patrick Amedori","role":"Pete","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xRQ07ZPwd2nn3ki6DGiTgJmpVWm.jpg"},{"id":59214,"name":"Cas Anvar","role":"Docteur Faht