lla strada del ritorno dall'ospedale,Angela impazzita provoca un incidente.La ragazza ricoverata in ospedale,resta in coma per quaranta giorni.Padre Lozano,sacerdote dell'ospedale,le pratica l'estrema unzione e viene staccata dalle macchine.A sorpresa,Angela si riprende.Tutto sembra tornato normale,ma è l'inizio di un incubo.","tagline":"Per duemila anni il Vaticano ha nascosto le prove del male"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In a highly secured vault deep within the walls of Vatican City, the Catholic Church holds thousands of old films and video footage documenting exorcisms/supposed exorcisms and other unexplained religious phenomena they feel the world is not ready to see. This is the first tape - Case 83-G - stolen from these archives and exposed to the public by an anonymous source.","tagline":"For 2,000 years the Vatican has recorded evidence of evil. May God have mercy on their souls."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i8PwIUHbuHlJWfrfcEGNYNl0t9m.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i8PwIUHbuHlJWfrfcEGNYNl0t9m.png","language":"en","width":785,"height":132}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iJWXqvaZ9X836hlonlmU3HEMNun.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iJWXqvaZ9X836hlonlmU3HEMNun.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eXN0zdTpm772ZCfnCeLAONguqxe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eXN0zdTpm772ZCfnCeLAONguqxe.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sWE8MJRm2ZmS0QyQBiavsP5NQNn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sWE8MJRm2ZmS0QyQBiavsP5NQNn.jpg","language":"en","width":675,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/udpc6GIuG6lAkPEi1gwoBhTXk7k.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/udpc6GIuG6lAkPEi1gwoBhTXk7k.jpg","language":"en","width":80